      "extract": "\\label{sec1} The present paper is the last part of a project carried out in a sequence of papers \\cite{schreiber3,schreiber5,schreiber6}. In these papers, we have prepared the foundations for transport 2-functors -- our axiomatic formulation of connection on non-abelian gerbes. The purpose of this section is to make the present paper self-contained; we collect and review the most important definitions and results",
